1
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:17,320
It was as a manager of the financial giant Fidelity that Lynch became known to the public.

2
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:22,560
As a manager of The Magellan Fund he crushed the stock index-

3
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:28,320
-And in 2003 he had the best 20-year yields ever-

4
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,640
-A of all fund managers through the ages behind them.

5
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:35,440
What is the secret?
Peter Lynch only knows that.

6
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:41,600
But he has been generous with tips and advice in his bestselling book:

7
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,800
"One Up On Wall Street".

8
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:45,640
Some of his tips are:

9
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:51,400
Maybe there is a store that you have been very impressed with.

10
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:55,640
Then it can give inspiration to look further on that share.

11
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:59,960
Maybe the market has not been given as good a picture of the company as you have.
